{"seq":32,"slug":"combat-system-design","title":"战斗系统设计","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"战斗系统设计-总览\">战斗系统设计·总览</h1><p>战斗系统是动作、格斗、ARPG、roguelike 这类游戏的心脏。它不是「一个伤害数字减另一个血条」那么简单，而是一台由帧、状态、判定框、缓冲队列、数值公式和反馈特效共同驱动的实时机器。这个 hub 把这台机器拆成四条递进的主线，从最底层的时间与状态，一直讲到让玩家「打着爽」的数据调优。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是「战斗基础」。任何攻击都发生在一个不断转动的循环里：感知敌人→决策出招→动作播放→结算结果→回到待机。我们先解剖这个<a href=\"foundations/combat-loop-anatomy\">战斗循环</a>，再深入到每个动作内部的<a href=\"foundations/action-states-frame-data\">状态机与帧数据</a>——起手、判定、收招三段帧，以及它们决定的帧优势。最后处理人机交互的「手感地基」：<a href=\"foundations/input-buffering-responsiveness\">输入缓冲与响应性</a>，让玩家在还没收招时按下的指令不被吞掉。这一章是底座，后面所有内容都站在它之上。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是「命中判定与反馈」，把一次攻击解析成确定的结果。先用几何<a href=\"hit-resolution/hitbox-hurtbox-systems\">攻击框与受击框</a>回答「打没打中」，再用<a href=\"hit-resolution/hit-reactions-hitstun\">受击反应与硬直</a>回答「打中之后对方进入什么状态」，最后用<a href=\"hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling\">伤害公式与数值缩放</a>回答「掉多少血」。这三篇构成一条完整的「判定→反应→结算」链路，是连招和平衡的前提。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是「系统深度」，决定战斗耐不耐玩。<a href=\"systems-depth/combo-system-design\">连招系统设计</a>把单次攻击串成有节奏的乐句；<a href=\"systems-depth/targeting-lock-on\">锁定与目标选择</a>解决 3D 空间里「打谁」的镜头与瞄准问题；<a href=\"systems-depth/ai-combat-encounter\">战斗AI与遭遇设计</a>则塑造对手的智能与一场战斗的起承转合。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是「平衡与手感」，让战斗既公平又爽快。<a href=\"balance-feel/weapon-ability-balancing\">武器与技能平衡</a>用功率预算和击杀时间约束数值；<a href=\"balance-feel/combat-feel-feedback\">打击感与反馈</a>用顿帧、震屏、特效把抽象判定包装成可感知的冲击；<a href=\"balance-feel/telemetry-combat-tuning\">战斗数据调优</a>则用遥测数据闭环修正前面所有环节的参数。</p>\n<p>四条主线是严格递进的：没有稳定的帧与状态，判定无从谈起；没有可靠的判定，连招和平衡就是沙上建塔；没有手感与数据，再精巧的系统玩家也感觉不到。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：动作/格斗程序员按 1→2→3→4 顺序通读，重点啃第一、二章。系统/数值策划可从第二章伤害公式切入，再跳到第四章平衡与调优。关卡/体验设计师可直接从第三章战斗AI与遭遇、第四章打击感读起。前置知识：建议先理解游戏引擎的主循环与定点更新（见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../game-engine-fundamentals/\">游戏引擎基础</a>），以及基础向量几何。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工：我们只讲「战斗」这一垂直切片的设计与实现，不展开通用渲染、物理引擎或网络同步的底层细节——那些属于各自专门的 hub，本 hub 在需要时点到并交叉链接过去。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"战斗基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"combat-loop-anatomy","title":"战斗循环解剖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/foundations/combat-loop-anatomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"action-states-frame-data","title":"动作状态与帧数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/foundations/action-states-frame-data"},{"seq":3,"slug":"input-buffering-responsiveness","title":"输入缓冲与响应性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/foundations/input-buffering-responsiveness"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"hit-resolution","title":"命中判定与反馈","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hitbox-hurtbox-systems","title":"攻击框与受击框系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hitbox-hurtbox-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hit-reactions-hitstun","title":"受击反应与硬直","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/hit-reactions-hitstun"},{"seq":3,"slug":"damage-formulas-scaling","title":"伤害公式与数值缩放","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems-depth","title":"系统深度","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"combo-system-design","title":"连招系统设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/combo-system-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"targeting-lock-on","title":"锁定与目标选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/targeting-lock-on"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-combat-encounter","title":"战斗AI与遭遇设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/systems-depth/ai-combat-encounter"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"balance-feel","title":"平衡与手感","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/balance-feel","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"weapon-ability-balancing","title":"武器与技能平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/balance-feel/weapon-ability-balancing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"combat-feel-feedback","title":"打击感与反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/balance-feel/combat-feel-feedback"},{"seq":3,"slug":"telemetry-combat-tuning","title":"战斗数据调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/combat-system-design/balance-feel/telemetry-combat-tuning"}]}]}